{{Term/Store|Silent Shroom|Silent Shrooms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Silent Shroom}}
Silent Shrooms can be found at the bases of [[Tree]]s in the [[Lanayru Great Spring]] and [[West Necluda]]. They are easier to notice during the nighttime due to their glow. Eating a Silent Shroom raw will grant [[Link]] half of a [[Heart]] of healing. Roasting a Silent Shroom in a [[Fire]] will result in a [[Toasty Silent Shroom]]. [[Meal]]s made in a [[Cooking Pot]] using a Silent Shroom will grant Link [[Stealth Up]] when consumed, which temporarily increases his [[Stealth]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Silent Shrooms can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Light Blue [[Dye]].

